ns about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressions of Frequency"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use expressions of frequency to say how many times you do an activity. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You ask the question:<br /> How often do you ... ?"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"02\",\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Expressions of Frequency </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Examples </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"every ... (day of the week)   <br />on ... (day of the week) nights  <br/>once (=one time) a week   <br />twice (=two times) a week  <br />(#) times a month\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Every Friday, I meet my friends for dinner.<br />  I play tennis on Wednesday nights. <br />  I meet my friend once a week. <br />  I take a yoga class twice a week. <br />  I watch a movie three times a month. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom </span>:     How often do you go to the gym?<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sam </span>:     Three times a week."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Telling the Time"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Look at the chart. You can use these expressions to tell the time. You use the Simple Present tense of  the verb <span class=\"strong\">to be </span> in sentences where you tell time."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"04\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Time </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Expression </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn2le02ob06img01.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's 1 p.m.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> It's  1 o'clock in the afternoon. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn2le02ob06img02.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's 3:35 a.m.<br />It's 3:35 p.m.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> It's a quarter to 4 in the morning.  <br />It's a quarter to 4 in the night. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"engenn2le02ob06img03.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's 9:15 p.m<br />It's 9:15 a.m.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's quarter past 9 in evening.   <br />It's quarter past 9 in morning. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "before "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when an event happens ahead of another "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition) 